<p><span class="body-copy"><span style="color: #ffffff; border-bottom-color: #ffffff;" class="link-color">Cash in while you can. Open a No Fee Chequing Account and set up an eligible direct deposit today of $100 or more for 4 straight months. Plus, you’ll pay no monthly fees, so you can stop saying goodbye to your money.</span></span></p> 
<p><span style="color: rgb(255,255,255); border-bottom-color: rgb(255,255,255);" class="link-color"><span class="mouse-type">Terms apply. Offer ends January 31, 2027.&nbsp;</span></span></p>
            
            
            
            
