                <ul> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Turn your phone into&nbsp;your wallet with&nbsp;<a href="/en/banking-simplii/mobile-payment.html" target="_self" class=" inlineLink DefaultColor" id="buttonid-1605728283512"><span class="no-wrap">mobile payment</span></a><b><br> </b></span></li> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Send, request and receive money for free&nbsp;with&nbsp;<a href="/en/banking-simplii/e-transfer.html" target="_self" class=" inlineLink DefaultColor" id="buttonid-1605728336823"><span class="no-wrap"><i>Interac</i>&nbsp;e-Transfer<sup>®</sup></span></a></span></li> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Transfer money internationally&nbsp;with $0 transfer fees<sup data-fragment-ref="/content/dam/disclaimers/simplii/banking/global-money-transfer-service-rates" data-footnote-type="numeric" data-fragment-variation="master" class="termsandconditions-footnote" style="padding-top: 45px; margin-top: -45px;"><a href="#fn2" class="termsandconditions-footnote-link footnote-numeric fn-lnk" aria-label="numbered link 2 (footnote)" style="" id="fn2-1-rf">2</a></sup>&nbsp;using&nbsp;<a href="/en/global-money-transfer.html" target="_self" class=" inlineLink DefaultColor" id="buttonid-1605728398667">Global Money Transfer</a>&nbsp;</span></li> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Get free delivery to your home or nearest Canada Post when you order&nbsp;<a href="/en/foreign-exchange.html" target="_self" class=" inlineLink DefaultColor" id="buttonid-1605728433149"><span class="no-wrap">foreign cash</span></a></span></li> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Use your Simplii sign on details to access&nbsp;<a href="/en/banking-simplii/interac-sign-in-service.html" target="_self" class=" inlineLink DefaultColor" id="buttonid-1605728454968">over 80&nbsp;government of Canada websites</a></span></li> 
</ul>
            
            
            
            
