                <h2><span class="banner-body-copy-bold">New in Canada? Make the switch to digital banking.</span><br> </h2> 
<p>Get the perks of no-fee daily banking with the New to Canada Banking Program. Complete the application online before you arrive or once you're here. Starting a new life can be complicated, but your banking doesn't have to be.</p>
            
            
            
            
